  "instructions": [
    "in a mortar and pestle, combine lime juice, garlic, ginger, salt, and black pepper.",
    "add pretzels to the mortar and pestle, and pound them into small pieces.",
    "add yeast, water, and coconut oil to the mortar and pestle, and mix until a smooth batter forms.",
    "transfer the batter to a bamboo steamer, and steam over boiling water for 20 minutes.",
    "remove the steamer from the heat, and let the pretzel delight cool for 5 minutes.",
    "serve the vibrant steamed pretzel delight warm, garnished with additional lime wedges if desired."
  ],
